  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut pumpkin into bite-sized chunks.\n• Slice red onion into thick wedges.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Roughly chop walnuts.\n• TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer and scrape out the seeds, if necessary!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68197485939c9c3068924ada/step-71475e00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place pumpkin and onion on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with herb & mushroom seasoning and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68197485939c9c3068924ada/step-d077a910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 5 minutes remaining, on a second lined oven tray, evenly stack 5 sheets of filo pastry (see ingredients) (one stack per person) with a drizzle of olive oil between each layer.\n• When cooked, place roasted onion and pumpkin in the centre of the pastry, leaving a 4cm border around the edge.\n• Cut marinated goat cheese into bite-sized chunks. Top veggies with cheese. Season with a pinch of salt and pepper.\n• Carefully fold pastry edges over filling, leaving the centre exposed.\n• TIP: Use the same lined oven tray from the pumpkin to cook your pastry, for extra flavour!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68197485939c9c3068924ada/step-1a331c20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Brush edges of pastry with olive oil.\n• Bake galette, until golden, 15-20 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68197485939c9c3068924ada/step-842a5e30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, in a large bowl, combine snacking tomatoes, spinach & rocket mix and balsamic vinaigrette dressing. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68197485939c9c3068924ada/step-c312f440.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut galette.\n• Divide pumpkin and goat cheese galette between plates.\n• Sprinkle walnuts and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using) over the galette.\n• Serve with cherry tomato salad and Italian truffle mayonnaise. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68197485939c9c3068924ada/step-7ec08f50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
